{"ID":"20240511110518-vhfncbu","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240511110518-vhfncbu","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511110518-vhfncbu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511123037-oh2sobh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240511160443-b0da1py\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513130305-0sxiy9h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:28,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"汉唐-089号（健筋骨丸.关节肌肉萎缩）","type":"doc","updated":"20240513130309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240511123037-oh2sobh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-oh2sobh","updated":"20240511123037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝主筋 , 肾主骨 , 筋疲与骨不健全 , 完全受此二脏管理 , 如果医师不知道这个道理是不能治好任何筋骨方面的疾病 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-b7mrndm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-b7mrndm","updated":"20240511123039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"年龄一过五十以後 , 筋与骨就会开始退化 , 适度的运动 , 是最好的保养方式 , 一旦有受伤则很不易痊愈 , 无法向年轻人一样 , 因此本药的目的就是为了老年人筋骨受伤之後 , 不易自己恢复而设计的 ."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-k91iktr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-k91iktr","updated":"20240511123045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"      一般而言 , 多发生在下肢部位 , 由於肾主下肢 , 故此药针对肾经及肝经的病变有极大的作用 , 再加入补骨舒筋的中药而制成的 , 但是必须长期服用而且必须减少或避免咸味很重的食物 , 才有机会恢复的."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-kwnon8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-kwnon8k","updated":"20240511123101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方内容 : 熟地补骨脂等."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-p69m3ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-p69m3ri","updated":"20240511123059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁忌: 忌咸味食物."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-tlit7kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-tlit7kb","updated":"20240511123103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用方法 : 中餐前 晚睡前各30颗."}]},{"ID":"20240511123037-lv2xric","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511123037-lv2xric","updated":"20240511123102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"副作用 : 无."}]},{"ID":"20240511133848-aiv51gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133848-aiv51gp"}},{"ID":"20240513130305-0sxiy9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240513130305-0sxiy9h","updated":"20240513130309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"健筋骨丸(關節肌肉萎縮)，類似於仙豐製作的健力行89號。"}]},{"ID":"20240511133849-f6kcqfw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240511133849-f6kcqfw"}},{"ID":"20240511133850-r5ynuye","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-r5ynuye","updated":"20240511133852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-89  健筋骨丸(关节肌肉萎缩)"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-eoqw6vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-eoqw6vy","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2006.12.11 A  录校：周胜陵）"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-h140h0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-h140h0k","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"健筋骨丸，治疗骨折肌肉萎缩的。看原文："}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-knke8tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-knke8tb","updated":"20240511160423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝主筋 , 肾主骨 , 筋疲与骨不健全 , 完全受此二脏管理 ,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-1d9wu2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-1d9wu2q","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前讲过人身体里面有五个系统，象里面有五个数，肺主皮毛，心主血脉，脾主肌肉，肝主筋，肾主骨，人身体任何一个地方包含在五行之数中"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-in2rw8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-in2rw8y","updated":"20240511160425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果医师不知道这个道理是不能治好任何筋骨方面的疾病 .年龄一过五十以后 , 筋与骨就会开始退化，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-owhdxxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-owhdxxc","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人到五十以后精气已半衰了，已经很少了。这个时候筋与骨就开始退化了，人走路时就会感觉腿脚无力气。我们看现在社会，人所生的疾病如骨病，什幺压到神经了，什幺骨刺增生、骨质疏松等系列疾病，小孩子青年人得的很少，都是过五十后就长了"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-w9yrkpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-w9yrkpp","updated":"20240511160428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"适度的运动 , 是最好的保养方式 ,"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-rh1wald","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-rh1wald","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所谓运动最终达到的结果是使身体内部气血的运动，不是来说一定是形体的运动，它就是注意里面通的问题，当气血能正常流通，身体中筋络全部能通，这时候肯定这个身体内部气血运行正常了，它属于气血运动，反过来运动过速反而伤及身体气血，所以运动要适度的运动。道家修炼主要是身体里面能够正常的运行，包括吐纳之法导引之术等等，太极拳也是道门的，原创是老道，道门讲述的就是这样的，它是归为这一个导引里面的，太极拳实际上也是导引的方法，它要讲述的是神，气与形要三合，这是太极拳里面的心法，形到什幺地方气到什幺地方然后神到什幺地方，这实际上是锻炼人身体里面的气血。"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-v6tgnzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-v6tgnzc","updated":"20240511160431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一旦有受伤则很不易痊愈 ，"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-fzklg8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-fzklg8d","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人不到这个年龄时，伤筋动骨还要一百天，何况是过了五十之后呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-npecuu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-npecuu7","updated":"20240511160435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"无法向年轻人一样 , 因此本药的目的就是为了老年人筋骨受伤之后 , 不易自己恢复而设计的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-u2vpiff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-u2vpiff","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它里面主要是补其肾精，去阳化，这阳化就是肝的升发作用，实际上是乙癸同源，治疗木与水的方子"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-8z37emh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-8z37emh","updated":"20240511160438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般而言 , 多发生在下肢部位 , 由于肾主下肢 , 故此药针对肾经及肝经的病变有极大的作用 ,包括可治坐骨神经痛，椎间盘突出，都可治疗，再加入补骨舒筋的中药而制成的 , 但是必须长期服用而且必须减少或避免咸味很重的食物 , 才有机会恢复的 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-j5jxkbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-j5jxkbx","updated":"20240511133850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什幺减免咸味重的食物，咸对肾气有什幺作用，以前说过了"}]},{"ID":"20240511133850-tcbxkbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511133850-tcbxkbr","updated":"20240511160441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方内容 : 熟地 补骨脂等 .    "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240511160443-b0da1py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240511160443-b0da1py"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"禁忌 : 忌咸味食物 ."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]}]}